  "notes": "USAGE:\nOften used with {力|りょく} as {統率|とうそつ}{力|りょく} (leadership ability), which is a common evaluation criterion for leaders, managers, and team captains.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {指揮|しき}: command, direction (more military/orchestral)\n- {率|ひき}いる: to lead, to command (verb)\n- リーダーシップ: leadership (loanword, more casual)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {統率|とうそつ}{力|りょく}: leadership ability\n- チームを{統率|とうそつ}する: lead a team\n- {軍|ぐん}を{統率|とうそつ}する: command an army\n- {統率|とうそつ}{力|りょく}がある: have leadership skills",
